agentic-playwright-mcp

This project builds on Playwright and Playwright MCP by Microsoft Corporation
(https://github.com/microsoft/playwright), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
It depends on patchright-core (https://github.com/Kaliiiiiiiiii-Vinyzu/patchright,
Apache License 2.0), a build of playwright-core that drives Chromium without
the DevTools calls sites can detect, installed under the name playwright-core,
and reuses its MCP browser tools; parts of the gateway follow the structure of
Playwright MCP's server code.

